<title>PHILIPPINES: Bacnotan Cement 6-month net up sharply.</title>
<headline>Bacnotan Cement 6-month net up sharply.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31.</p>
<p>			     (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover			1,038 vs 860.936</p>
<p>    Net income		  102.865 vs  81.73</p>
<p>Note - Company's full name is Bacnotan Cement Corp, a unit of Bacnotan Consolidated Industries Inc.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-8937</p>
